<body class="home wp-singular page-template page-template-elementor_canvas page page-id-9 wp-custom-logo wp-embed-responsive wp-theme-hello-elementor hello-elementor-default elementor-default elementor-template-canvas elementor-kit-6 elementor-page elementor-page-9">
			<div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="9" class="elementor elementor-9" data-elementor-post-type="page">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-276638f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="276638f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b058ee3 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="b058ee3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
					<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Partiu Corrida — Corridas de Rua no Interior de SP</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,700&family=Barlow:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --orange: #FF4E00;
    --orange-light: #FF7A38;
    --blue-dark: #0A1628;
    --blue-mid: #112244;
    --blue-accent: #1A3A6B;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
    --gray-light: #F4F4F2;
    --gray-text: #6B7280;
    --yellow: #FFB800;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;
    background: var(--white);
    color: var(--blue-dark);
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* ── NAV ── */
  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0 5%;
    height: 72px;
    background: rgba(10,22,40,0.96);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }

  .nav-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    height: 72px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .nav-logo-icon {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    background: var(--orange);
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: white;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .nav-logo-img {
    width: 130px;
    height: 40px;
    max-width: 130px;
    max-height: 40px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background-image: url('https://partiucorrida.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Copyright-©-2025-·-Partiu-Corrida-·-Todos-os-direitos-reservados.webp');
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: left center;
    background-size: contain;
  }

  .nav-logo-text {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: white;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .nav-logo-text span { color: var(--orange); }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 36px;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--orange); }

  .nav-cta {
    background: var(--orange);
    color: white !important;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: background 0.2s !important;
  }

  .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--orange-light) !important; color: white !important; }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: var(--blue-dark);
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-video-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--blue-dark);
  }

  .hero-video-bg iframe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 100vw;
    height: 56.25vw; /* 16:9 */
    min-height: 100vh;
    min-width: 177.78vh; /* 16:9 */
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    pointer-events: none;
    border: none;
  }

  .hero-video-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    background: rgba(10,22,40,0.55);
  }

  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 70% 50%, rgba(255,78,0,0.18) 0%, transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 60% at 20% 80%, rgba(26,58,107,0.6) 0%, transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(10,22,40,0.55) 0%, rgba(17,34,68,0.4) 50%, rgba(10,22,40,0.55) 100%);
  }

  .hero-grid-lines {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 60px 60px;
  }

  .hero-diagonal {
    position: absolute;
    right: -5%;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 55%;
    z-index: 1;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 0%, rgba(255,78,0,0.06) 100%);
    clip-path: polygon(15% 0%, 100% 0%, 100% 100%, 0% 100%);
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    padding: 0 5%;
    padding-top: 72px;
    padding-bottom: 140px;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--orange);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 32px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--orange);
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(56px, 8vw, 96px);
    line-height: 0.92;
    color: white;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .hero-title .accent { color: var(--orange); }
  .hero-title .italic { font-style: italic; }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-bottom: 44px;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: var(--orange);
    color: white;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 16px 32px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--orange-light); transform: translateY(-2px); }

  .btn-outline {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: transparent;
    color: white;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 16px 32px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-outline:hover { border-color: white; color: white; }

  .hero-stats {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 48px;
    left: 5%;
    right: 5%;
    display: flex;
    gap: 48px;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 36px;
    color: white;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stat-number span { color: var(--orange); }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .hero-divider {
    width: 1px;
    height: 48px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    align-self: center;
  }

  /* ── SECTION BASE ── */
  section { padding: 96px 5%; }

  .section-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--orange);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .section-tag::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 24px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--orange);
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 60px);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .section-sub {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--gray-text);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  /* ── SOBRE NÓS ── */
  .sobre {
    background: var(--gray-light);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .sobre-img-wrap {
    position: relative;
  }

  .sobre-img-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4/3;
    background-image: url('https://partiucorrida.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/image-9.webp');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    border-radius: 8px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .sobre-badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -20px;
    right: -20px;
    background: var(--orange);
    color: white;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .sobre-badge strong { font-size: 36px; display: block; }
  .sobre-badge span { font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; opacity: 0.9; }

  .sobre-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 28px 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .sobre-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .sobre-list li::before {
    content: '';
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background: var(--orange);
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .sobre-grupo {
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--gray-text);
  }

  .sobre-grupo strong { color: var(--blue-dark); }

  /* ── CORRIDAS ── */
  .corridas { background: white; }

  .corridas-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: 52px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .corridas-tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    background: var(--gray-light);
    padding: 4px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .tab-btn {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--gray-text);
  }

  .tab-btn.active {
    background: var(--blue-dark);
    color: white;
  }

  .cards-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .event-card {
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
    transition: transform 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;
  }

  .event-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
  }

  .card-img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16/9;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue-mid), var(--blue-accent));
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    padding: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
  }

  .card-img-1 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e, #16213e); }
  .card-img-2 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f3460, #533483); }
  .card-img-3 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1B4332, #2D6A4F); }

  .card-date-badge {
    background: var(--orange);
    color: white;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 5px 10px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .card-body {
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .card-name {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 20px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue-dark);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .card-meta {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--gray-text);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .card-distances {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .distance-pill {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    background: var(--gray-light);
    color: var(--blue-dark);
    border-radius: 20px;
  }

  .card-cta {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--orange);
    color: white;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .card-cta:hover { background: var(--orange-light); }

  /* ── GALERIA ── */
  .galeria {
    background: var(--blue-dark);
    padding-top: 80px;
    padding-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .galeria .section-title { color: white; }

  .galeria-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    grid-auto-rows: 200px;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  .galeria-item {
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--blue-accent);
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 28px;
    opacity: 0.85;
    transition: opacity 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
  }

  .galeria-item:hover { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.02); }

  .galeria-item.span-2 {
    grid-column: span 2;
  }

  .galeria-item.tall {
    grid-row: span 2;
  }

  .galeria-label {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    padding: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,0.7));
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  /* ── CONTATO ── */
  .contato {
    background: white;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .contato-info { padding-top: 8px; }

  .contato-info .section-sub { margin-bottom: 40px; }

  .info-items {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .info-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .info-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background: var(--orange);
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 18px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .info-item-text strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--blue-dark);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .info-item-text span {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--gray-text);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .form-wrap {
    background: var(--gray-light);
    padding: 40px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .form-title {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 22px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: var(--blue-dark);
  }

  .form-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .form-group.full { grid-column: span 2; }

  .form-group label {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue-dark);
  }

  .form-group input,
  .form-group textarea,
  .form-group select {
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border: 1.5px solid #E5E7EB;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    background: white;
    color: var(--blue-dark);
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .form-group input:focus,
  .form-group textarea:focus,
  .form-group select:focus {
    border-color: var(--orange);
  }

  .form-group textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 100px; }

  .form-submit {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 14px;
    background: var(--orange);
    color: white;
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-top: 8px;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .form-submit:hover { background: var(--orange-light); }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  footer {
    background: var(--blue-dark);
    padding: 64px 5% 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }

  .footer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .footer-brand { }

  .footer-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .footer-desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .footer-socials {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .social-btn {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 16px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .social-btn:hover { background: var(--orange); }

  .social-icon {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    fill: currentColor;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    display: block;
  }

  .footer-col-title {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .footer-links {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--orange); }

  .footer-contact-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .footer-contact-item .icon { font-size: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }

  .footer-contact-item span {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    padding-top: 24px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .footer-bottom p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  }

  .footer-bottom a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); text-decoration: none; }

  .footer-grupo {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  }

  .footer-credit {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  }

  .footer-credit a {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.48);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: color .2s ease;
  }

  .footer-credit a:hover {
    color: var(--orange);
  }

  /* ── SCROLL ANIMATIONS ── */
  .fade-up {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
  }

  .fade-up.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .fade-up-delay-1 { transition-delay: 0.1s; }
  .fade-up-delay-2 { transition-delay: 0.2s; }
  .fade-up-delay-3 { transition-delay: 0.3s; }

  /* ── TAB PANELS ── */
  .cards-panel { display: none; }
  .cards-panel.active {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .tab-btn.active {
    background: var(--blue-dark);
    color: white;
  }

  /* ── HAMBURGER ── */
  .nav-hamburger {
    display: none;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 5px;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 4px;
    background: none;
    border: none;
  }

  .nav-hamburger span {
    display: block;
    width: 24px;
    height: 2px;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }

  .nav-hamburger.open span:nth-child(1) { transform: translateY(7px) rotate(45deg); }
  .nav-hamburger.open span:nth-child(2) { opacity: 0; }
  .nav-hamburger.open span:nth-child(3) { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg); }

  .nav-mobile {
    display: none;
    position: fixed;
    top: 72px;
    left: 0; right: 0;
    background: rgba(10,22,40,0.98);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    padding: 24px 5%;
    z-index: 99;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .nav-mobile.open { display: flex; }

  .nav-mobile a {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .nav-mobile a:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .nav-mobile a:hover, .nav-mobile a.cta { color: var(--orange); }

  /* ── RESPONSIVO ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {

    /* Nav */
    .nav-links { display: none; }
    .nav-hamburger { display: flex; }

    /* Hero */
    .hero { min-height: 100svh; align-items: flex-start; padding-top: 0; }
    .hero-content { padding-top: calc(72px + 48px); padding-bottom: 0; max-width: 100%; }
    .hero-runner { display: none; }
    .hero-stats {
      position: static;
      margin-top: 48px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 24px 36px;
      padding: 0 5% 48px;
    }
    .hero-divider { display: none; }

    /* Sobre */
    .sobre {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
      padding: 64px 5%;
    }
    .sobre-badge { right: 0; bottom: -16px; }

    /* Corridas */
    .corridas { padding: 64px 5%; }
    .corridas-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; }
    .cards-panel.active {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    /* Galeria */
    .galeria { padding: 64px 5%; }
    .galeria-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      grid-auto-rows: 160px;
    }
    .galeria-item.span-2 { grid-column: span 2; }
    .galeria-item.tall { grid-row: span 1; }

    /* Contato */
    .contato {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
      padding: 64px 5%;
    }

    /* Footer */
    .footer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 36px;
    }
    .footer-brand { grid-column: span 2; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {

    /* Nav */
    .nav-logo-text { font-size: 17px; }

    /* Hero */
    .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; }
    .btn-primary, .btn-outline { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
    .hero-stats { gap: 20px 28px; }

    /* Sobre */
    .sobre-badge { right: 8px; }
    .section-title { font-size: clamp(32px, 9vw, 48px); }

    /* Corridas tabs */
    .corridas-tabs { width: 100%; }
    .corridas-tabs .tab-btn { flex: 1; }

    /* Galeria */
    .galeria-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      grid-auto-rows: 220px;
    }
    .galeria-item.span-2 { grid-column: span 1; }

    /* Formulário */
    .form-wrap { padding: 24px 20px; }
    .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .form-group.full { grid-column: span 1; }
    .form-group { grid-column: span 1; }

    /* Footer */
    .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .footer-brand { grid-column: span 1; }
    .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; text-align: center; }
  }


  /* ── COMO ATUAMOS ── */
  .como-atuamos {
    background: var(--blue-dark);
    color: white;
  }
  .como-atuamos .section-title { color: white; }
  .como-atuamos .section-sub { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.68); max-width: 760px; }
  .atuamos-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: 44px;
  }
  .atuamos-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 32px;
  }
  .atuamos-card h3 {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 28px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .atuamos-card p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.68); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .atuamos-card p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .atuamos-services {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 22px;
  }
  .atuamos-service {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgba(255,78,0,0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,78,0,0.22);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88);
  }
  .atuamos-highlight {
    margin-top: 22px;
    padding-left: 18px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--orange);
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  /* ── PARCEIROS ── */
  .parceiros { background: var(--gray-light); }
  .parceiros-header { max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 44px; }
  .partners-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0,1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .partner-card {
    min-height: 148px;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .partner-card img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 66px;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }
  .partner-card span {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .6px;
    color: var(--blue-dark);
  }

  /* Preserva as artes e fotos completas, sem cortes */
  .card-img {
    background-size: contain !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    background-position: center !important;
    background-color: #EEF1F5;
  }
  .galeria-item {
    background-size: contain !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    background-position: center !important;
    background-color: #0F2039;
  }
@media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .nav-links { gap: 18px; }
    .nav-links a { font-size: 14px; }
    .partners-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr)); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .atuamos-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
    .partners-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .atuamos-services { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .partners-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
    .partner-card { min-height: 120px; padding: 14px; }
    .partner-card img { height: 52px; }
  }


  /* ── Formulário de contato (sincronizado com o Formulário Elementor) */
  .pc-form-status { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; min-height: 1px; }
  .pc-form-status.is-success { color: #2ecc71; }
  .pc-form-status.is-error { color: #ff6b6b; }
  .form-submit[disabled] { opacity: .6; cursor: wait; }
  #pc-contact-form .is-invalid { border-color: #ff6b6b !important; }
  .footer-grupo a:hover strong { color: #FF6B1A !important; }
  body:not(.elementor-editor-active) .pc-elementor-form { display: none !important; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <a href="#" class="nav-logo">
    <div class="nav-logo-img" role="img" aria-label="Partiu Corrida"></div>
  </a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
    <li><a href="#corridas">Corridas</a></li>
    <li><a href="#como-atuamos">Como atuamos</a></li>
    <li><a href="#sobre">Sobre nós</a></li>
    <li><a href="#parceiros">Parceiros</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contato">Contato</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contato" class="nav-cta">Entre em contato</a></li>
  </ul>
  <button class="nav-hamburger" aria-label="Menu">
    <span></span><span></span><span></span>
  </button>
</nav>

<!-- MENU MOBILE -->
<nav class="nav-mobile">
  <a href="#">Home</a>
  <a href="#corridas">Corridas</a>
  <a href="#como-atuamos">Como atuamos</a>
  <a href="#sobre">Sobre nós</a>
  <a href="#parceiros">Parceiros</a>
  <a href="#contato">Contato</a>
  <a href="#contato" class="cta">Entre em contato →</a>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-video-bg">
    <iframe
      id="hero-yt-video"
      src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/w4jVnhz2428?autoplay=1&mute=1&loop=1&playlist=w4jVnhz2428&controls=0&showinfo=0&modestbranding=1&rel=0&iv_load_policy=3&playsinline=1&disablekb=1&fs=0"
      title="Vídeo de fundo"
      frameborder="0"
      allow="autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture"
      allowfullscreen="false"
      referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
    ></iframe>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-video-overlay"></div>
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-grid-lines"></div>
  <div class="hero-diagonal"></div>

  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Corridas de Rua · Interior de SP</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">
      Você foi<br>
      feito pra<br>
      <span class="accent italic">correr.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      Organizamos as melhores corridas de rua do interior de São Paulo. Eventos que conectam corredores, marcas e comunidades.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#corridas" class="btn-primary">Ver próximas corridas →</a>
      <a href="#sobre" class="btn-outline">Sobre nós</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-stats">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-number">20<span>+</span></div>
      <div class="stat-label">Anos de experiência</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-divider"></div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-number">50<span>+</span></div>
      <div class="stat-label">Eventos realizados</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-divider"></div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-number">10k<span>+</span></div>
      <div class="stat-label">Corredores nas ruas</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-divider"></div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-number">15<span>+</span></div>
      <div class="stat-label">Cidades atendidas</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- COMO ATUAMOS -->
<section class="como-atuamos" id="como-atuamos">
  <div class="section-tag">Como atuamos</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Sua corrida. Sua marca.<br>Uma experiência completa.</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">
    Você já pensou em ter uma corrida com a cara da sua empresa? O mercado de corrida de rua está crescendo de forma impressionante. No interior de São Paulo, o crescimento chegou a incríveis 319%. É nesse mercado que a Partiu Corrida entra: transformamos marcas, empresas e negócios em grandes experiências esportivas.
  </p>
  <div class="atuamos-grid">
    <div class="atuamos-card fade-up">
      <h3>Eventos sob medida para sua marca</h3>
      <p>Criamos corridas personalizadas de acordo com o objetivo de cada parceiro, cuidando de toda a operação do evento.</p>
      <div class="atuamos-services">
        <div class="atuamos-service">Inscrições</div>
        <div class="atuamos-service">Percurso</div>
        <div class="atuamos-service">Licenças e trânsito</div>
        <div class="atuamos-service">Ambulância</div>
        <div class="atuamos-service">Cronometragem</div>
        <div class="atuamos-service">Kits e arena</div>
        <div class="atuamos-service">Comunicação</div>
        <div class="atuamos-service">Estrutura operacional</div>
      </div>
      <div class="atuamos-highlight">Você define o objetivo.<br>A Partiu cuida de todo o resto.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="atuamos-card fade-up fade-up-delay-1">
      <h3>Sua marca também pode estar nos nossos eventos</h3>
      <p>Sua empresa também pode entrar como patrocinadora dos eventos realizados pela Partiu Corrida e pelo Grupo Noblu Sports, conectando sua marca a milhares de corredores e criando experiências relevantes com o público.</p>
      <p>São diferentes possibilidades de ativação, exposição, relacionamento e experiência de marca, para sua empresa estar presente onde as pessoas estão e se conectar com um dos esportes que mais cresce no Brasil.</p>
      <div class="atuamos-highlight">Você escolhe como quer participar.<br>A gente cria a conexão.</div>
      <p style="margin-top:24px;"><strong style="color:white;">Experiência não falta.</strong> São mais de 20 anos de atuação no esporte e mais de 50 mil atletas inscritos somente em 2026 nos eventos realizados pelo Grupo Noblu Sports.</p>
      <a href="#contato" class="btn-primary" style="margin-top:8px;">Partiu transformar sua marca em experiência? →</a>
